<p style="text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;"><b><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: lime;">TODA&nbsp;VENTA&nbsp;MKT DE “CONTADO”&nbsp;<span style="color:red">ES RESPONSABILIDAD DEL VENDEDOR&nbsp;</span>VALIDAR QUE EL
